      "text": "Trigger A creature within reach of the dragon's claw uses a move action or leaves a square during a move action it's using\n\nRequirements The triggering creature is in bright light or dim light and has a shadow\n\n---\nEffect The dragon makes a claw Strike against the triggering creature. On a hit, the trigger creature also has its shadow pinned in place, restricting its movement. The creature treats the area of the dragon's aura as difficult terrain until it uses an Interact action to unpin its shadow. If the area was already difficult terrain, the creature treats it as greater difficult terrain."
